SGLang LoRA adapter sync over the transfer_mesh channel (coda megatron.lora.merge=false).
Apply after docker/patch/sglang-0.5.21.patch, from the SGLang repo root.

UpdateWeightsFromChannelReqInput gains lora_adapter_sync / lora_name / lora_config_dict /
lora_pinned / lora_id. With lora_adapter_sync=True the received lora_A/lora_B replace the
adapter `lora_name` (unload + load under a new lora_id; 0.5.21 has no upsert). Needs --enable-lora.

Also fixes FusedMoEWithLoRA hiding base expert params under experts.base_layer.*, which made
any post-wrap load_weights silently skip every routed expert.

